# keys index (lightweight)
# Map a short key to one or more prompts/orchestrations.
# Use single-token, kebab-case keys.

# examples
canvas-maintenance: handoff → task → healthcheck
ui-debug-panel: handoff → task → test-generation → healthcheck
refactor-quality: handoff → create-plan → task → healthcheck
sync-docs: handoff → create-plan → task → healthcheck
ops-cleanup: handoff → task → healthcheck

# notes
# - Prefer calling `handoff` with the work request; it composes downstream prompts automatically.
# - Keep keys short and descriptive; avoid spaces.
